{
  "name": "Create Thrall",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to infect a humanoid's mind with the alien magic of your patron. You can use your action to touch an Incapacitated humanoid. That creature is then Charmed by you until a Remove Curse spell is cast on it, the Charmed condition is removed from it, or you use this feature again.</p><p>You can communicate telepathically with the Charmed creature as long as the two of you are on the same plane of existence.</p>",
